morning about what's a virus,

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:25.160
how the virus different than
bacteria, are viruses living?

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.854
You know, what's the definition
of life, what's RNA and DNA,

00:09:28.854 --> 00:09:30.870
how do viruses replicate?

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:33.990
So this is obviously very,
very important things

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:36.080
to think about that's very
relevant to the world right now

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.770
and I encourage you to,
depending on your interest

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:41.913
to start digging in and
see what works for you.

